# Inherited from the upstream GeoSeg project. Trimmed 2026-07-28: it carried a full Python-package
# ignore list plus `*.png`, `*.npy` and `data/`, which fought the root .gitignore -- the root one
# deliberately TRACKS small derived .npy under analysis/. It also whitelisted two files that have
# never existed here. Only the bytecode rules are kept; everything else belongs at the root.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
